        <p>G. T. P. G. T. P. Wigan 0 5 15 Salford 0 1 3 Warrington Wigan Highfield Rochdale Hornets 0 4 12 Pemberton WARRINGTON "A "V. BROUGHTON RANGERS "A." —Played at Warrington before three thousand spectators Fish figured in the home threequarter line. Broughton pressed at the start, and Woodward scored from a pack near the line. Warrington forced the pace after this, and Foster soon estishlished the " Wirepullers " in a strong position. From some loose work Fish punted</p>
