ing took care to leave both the hotel and the city of Paris half-an-hour before the King of the Belgians arrived—(applause)—and thereby his fellow citzens of this great empire received one more illustra-</p>
        <p>Sunday I caught a very bad cold; Monday it took a rather firm hold; Tuesday I had to take to my bed; Wednesday I thought I'd shortly be dead; Thcrsday came and I got a bit worse; Friday I had to send for a nurse; But Saturday brought relief swift and sure— A bottle of Woods' Great Peppermint Care.—Advt.</p>
