        <p>" A Parochial Tea. 1 The Parr Hall was crowded on Thursday evening, the occasion being the Parish Church Parochial' gathering. Tea was on the tables at six o'clock and an excellent repast was partaken of by 600 persons. 1 Dancing was indulged in from eight until the early hours of Friday moruing„ whilst at half-past eight 1 Mr. F. M. Darby organised a variety entertainment in 1 the crush roo:n. The following were the artistes : . Messrs. F. Stansfield, F. M. Darby, A. Greenough, F. Williams, P. C. Price, Parsons and the Parish Church Choir. The catering was in the capable hands of Messrs. Atkinson, Ltd.</p>
